{
  "info": {
    "name": "Trading Bot IA — Backend API",
    "description": "Collection Postman pour le backend Python/FastAPI du Trading Bot IA.\n\n## Authentification\n1. Inscrire un compte avec `POST /auth/register`\n2. Se connecter avec `POST /auth/login` → le token JWT est automatiquement capturé dans `{{token}}`\n3. Connecter la plateforme Kraken Spot avec `POST /auth/platform-connect`\n\n## Variables\n- `{{baseUrl}}` : `http://localhost:8000` (modifiable)\n- `{{token}}` : JWT token (rempli automatiquement par le script de login)\n\n## Routes\n- 22 endpoints versionnés sous `/api/v1`\n- 1 healthcheck public `/health`\n\n## Intégration Kraken Spot\n- Prix réels via API publique Kraken (Ticker, OHLC)\n- Exécution d'ordres via API privée (HMAC-SHA512)\n- Frais Kraken taker ~0.26% intégrés aux stats de performance\n- Paire de trading configurable (kraken_pair, ex: XXBTZUSD)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tradeId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Healthcheck",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Healthcheck — vérifie la connexion DB. Aucune auth requise."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"trader01\",\n  \"email\": \"trader01@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Inscrit un nouvel utilisateur. Retourne 201 avec l'objet créé, 409 si username ou email déjà pris."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "  console.log('Token capturé automatiquement');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"trader01\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Connecte l'utilisateur et retourne un JWT. Le token est automatiquement capturé dans la variable `{{token}}` pour les requêtes suivantes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Connect Platform",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/platform-connect",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "platform-connect"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"platform_name\": \"kraken\",\n  \"api_key\": \"your-kraken-api-key\",\n  \"api_secret\": \"your-kraken-api-secret\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Connecte la plateforme Kraken Spot. Les clés API sont chiffrées (Fernet) et jamais retournées. Un health check réel (Time + Balance) est effectué. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Platform Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/platform-status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "platform-status"]
            },
            "description": "Retourne le statut de connexion à la plateforme de trading (connected/disconnected/error). Auth JWT requise."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trading Config",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Trading Params",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config/trading-params",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "config", "trading-params"]
            },
            "description": "Récupère les paramètres de trading actuels. Les valeurs par défaut : gain_limit=5%, loss_limit=-3%, capital/trade=2%, quota=20/mois, durée_min=60min, mode_simulation=true. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Trading Params",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config/trading-params",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "config", "trading-params"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"gain_limit_pct\": 8.0,\n  \"loss_limit_pct\": -5.0,\n  \"capital_pct_per_trade\": 3.0,\n  \"max_trades_per_month\": 30,\n  \"min_holding_duration\": 45,\n  \"tax_alert_threshold\": 500.0,\n  \"kraken_pair\": \"XXBTZUSD\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Mise à jour partielle de la config. Tous les champs sont optionnels. Bornes : gain 0-100%, loss -100-0%, capital 0-100%, quota 1-500. kraken_pair: paire Kraken (ex: XXBTZUSD). Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set Simulation Mode (RG-5)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config/simulation-mode",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "config", "simulation-mode"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"simulation_mode\": false,\n  \"confirm\": true\n}"
            },
            "description": "Bascule entre mode simulation et mode réel. RG-5 : le champ `confirm` doit être true pour désactiver la simulation. Sans confirmation, retourne 400. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bot Control",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Start Bot",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bot/start",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "bot", "start"]
            },
            "description": "Démarre le bot de trading. RG-6 : refuse (400) si la plateforme n'est pas connectée. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Stop Bot (RG-6: arrêt immédiat)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bot/stop",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "bot", "stop"]
            },
            "description": "Arrête le bot immédiatement (RG-6). Plus aucune analyse n'est déclenchée après cet appel. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Bot Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bot/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "bot", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Retourne le statut du bot (running/stopped), la date du dernier cycle, et la date de démarrage. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "History",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Trades (paginated)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history/trades?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "history", "trades"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1", "description": "Numéro de page (>= 1)" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20", "description": "Nombre de résultats par page (1-100)" },
                { "key": "is_simulated", "value": "", "description": "Filtrer par mode simulation (true/false)", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "date_from", "value": "", "description": "Date début (YYYY-MM-DD)", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "date_to", "value": "", "description": "Date fin (YYYY-MM-DD)", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "symbol", "value": "", "description": "Filtrer par symbole (ex: BTCUSDT)", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Liste paginée des trades. Filtres optionnels : is_simulated, date_from, date_to, symbol. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Stats",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history/stats",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "history", "stats"]
            },
            "description": "Statistiques de performance : nombre total de trades, trades gagnants/perdants, taux de réussite, gain/perte cumulé, total_fees, PnL net (net des frais Kraken ~0.26% taker). Auth JWT requise."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tax Tracking",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Tax Counters (RG-8, RG-11)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/counters",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tax", "counters"]
            },
            "description": "Compteurs fiscaux : nombre de trades ce mois (RG-8), quota mensuel, volume fiat converti sur l'année (RG-11), seuil d'alerte. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Export CSV (RG-11)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/export",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "tax", "export"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "date_from", "value": "", "description": "Date début (YYYY-MM-DD)", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "date_to", "value": "", "description": "Date fin (YYYY-MM-DD)", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Export fiscal au format CSV (RG-11). Retourne les headers et les lignes de vente avec montant fiat. Filtres de date optionnels. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Notifications",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Unread Notifications",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "notifications", ""]
            },
            "description": "Liste des notifications non lues. Retourne un tableau vide si aucune notification. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark Notification as Read",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{tradeId}}/read",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "notifications", "{{tradeId}}", "read"]
            },
            "description": "Marque une notification comme lue. Remplacez `{{tradeId}}` par l'ID de la notification. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark All as Read",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "notifications", "read-all"]
            },
            "description": "Marque toutes les notifications non lues comme lues. Retourne le nombre de notifications marquées. Auth JWT requise."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
